# 👑 Golden Ticket – Kerberos Trust Abuse

## 📌 Overview
Golden Ticket attacks involve forging Kerberos tickets to impersonate users.

---

## 🎯 Objective
Understand impact of compromised Kerberos trust.

---

## 🧭 Workflow (Conceptual)

1. Compromise domain trust material
2. Generate forged authentication ticket (lab only)
3. Access resources as privileged user

---

## 🔍 What to Look For

### ⚠️ Indicators
- Long-lived Kerberos tickets
- Authentication without password usage
- Access to multiple systems rapidly

---

### 📊 Logs
- Event ID anomalies
- Unusual ticket lifetimes
- Repeated privileged access

---

## 🛡️ Detection

- Monitor Kerberos ticket anomalies
- Detect abnormal TGT usage
- SIEM correlation

---

## 🔐 Prevention

- Secure domain controllers
- Rotate KRBTGT account regularly
- Monitor privileged access

---

## 🧠 DPCI Notes

- Extremely high impact attack
- Treat as full domain compromise
- Immediate incident response required
